# Creating Autoplay Background Videos 🎥

For hero section background video loops:

```html_not
<video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="bg-video">
  <source src="bg-loop.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>
```

```css_not
.bg-video {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover; /* Crops and scales video to fill container without distortion */
  z-index: -1;
}
```

> 💡 **Autoplay Policy:** Browsers strictly block autoplaying videos that have audio. You **must** include the `muted` attribute for autoplay to succeed!
